    <main class="doc">
      <h1>Privacy policy: TypeTalk</h1>
      <p class="updated">Effective 21 October 2026.</p>

      <p class="summary">TypeTalk does not collect your personal data, does not send it to us and does not share it with anyone. There are no accounts, no analytics and no ads.</p>

      <h2>Who makes the app</h2>
      <!-- Replace [Full Name] with your full name before publishing. -->
      <p>TypeTalk is developed by Shoxi Labs ([Full Name]). For any privacy questions, write to <a href="mailto:shoxilabs.dev@gmail.com">shoxilabs.dev@gmail.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>Data on your device</h2>
      <p>The text you type, your saved notes (up to 10) and settings such as font and colors are stored only on your device. We don't send them anywhere and have no access to them. Uninstalling the app deletes this data.</p>
      <p>If Android backup is turned on for your device, the system may back up the app's data to your Google account. You control this backup in your device settings, and we have no access to it.</p>

      <h2>Microphone and speech to text</h2>
      <p>When you turn on speech to text, TypeTalk uses the microphone and the speech recognition service built into your Android device, usually Google's. Depending on your device settings, speech is processed on the device itself or by that service provider on its servers, under its <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">privacy policy</a>. We never receive or store the audio or the text.</p>
      <p>The microphone is used only while speech to text is turned on.</p>

      <h2>Text to speech</h2>
      <p>To speak text aloud, TypeTalk uses the text-to-speech system built into your device.</p>

      <h2>Permissions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Microphone:</strong> only for speech to text, when you turn it on.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>TypeTalk does not collect personal data from anyone, including children.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Because we don't collect personal data, we hold no data about you to show, correct or delete. If you have a question, contact us at the address above.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy, we'll publish the new version on this page with a new date.</p>
    </main>
  </div>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">© 2026 Shoxi Labs · <a href="/en/">Home</a></div>
